WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Paper stamp cards get lost.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Scan Perks. Put a QR on the counter.

00:16.000 --> 00:26.000
Every visit earns a stamp toward a free coffee.

00:26.000 --> 00:36.000
Send an offer when it is quiet. Double stamps till 6 pm.

00:36.000 --> 00:44.500
Turn first visits into regulars. Done.
